OL,3,GNEWSAGraffiti from the past found
OL,4,Aduring restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Very Revd Toby Wright, Dean of
OL,7,FWells, said the find was one of the
OL,8,F"gifts that Vicars' Close keeps
OL,9,Foffering us" and had remained hidden
OL,10,Ffor centuries.
